# Build outputs
/build/
/dist/
*.iso
*.iso.sha256
*.rpm

# rpmbuild working trees
/rpmbuild/

# cargo (make targets build into build/cargo-target; this covers plain
# `cargo build` runs inside the crate directories)
#
# Deliberately a pattern rather than one line per crate. The list used to be
# enumerated, lumen-sys was added without its line, and the first `cargo test`
# in that directory put eleven hundred build artifacts in front of a commit.
# Every crate here is its own cargo project, so "a directory called target next
# to a Cargo.toml" is the actual rule — write that instead of a list that has
# to be remembered.
target/

# Private key material. The PUBLIC signing key is committed on purpose —
# packages/keys/RPM-GPG-KEY-lumen ships to every appliance — so this names the
# shapes a private half arrives in rather than ignoring the directory. The
# private key belongs in the repository secrets and nowhere in a checkout; see
# docs/updates.md.
*.private.asc
*secret-key*.asc
*.gpg
*.pgp

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
